  "description": "This set has 20 Procreate Butterfly Stamps and 2 bonus brushes. \nThis set comes with several stamps that can be layered to add additional texture and dimension when creating your showcases. The bonus brushes are great to add texture, shading, and character. By having them included with the stamps, there’s no need to go searching for additional brushes.\nThis set is great to use for cards, planners, printables, wall art, stickers, coloring pages or anything your mind can create.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This set has 20 Procreate Butterfly Stamps and 2 bonus brushes. </p>\n<p>This set comes with several stamps that can be layered to add additional texture and dimension when creating your showcases. The bonus brushes are great to add texture, shading, and character. By having them included with the stamps, there’s no need to go searching for additional brushes.</p>\n<p>This set is great to use for cards, planners, printables, wall art, stickers, coloring pages or anything your mind can create.</p>",
